# shim_server.py is fetched verbatim by the auto-updater and hashed against
# manifest.json's sha256. Line endings MUST be deterministic or the hash
# check fails on every platform that commits with a different eol policy.
# Pin to LF everywhere — that's what GitHub raw serves and what the
# updater writes to disk.
*           text=auto eol=lf
shim_server.py  text eol=lf
manifest.json   text eol=lf
*.py        text eol=lf
*.json      text eol=lf
*.md        text eol=lf
